# msc/system/ — working area for the Claude Code system-prompt redesign
# (created 2026-07-17).
#
# Policy (Joseph, 2026-07-17): this directory is research-heavy and most of it
# stays LOCAL ONLY. We do NOT commit the CC-specific research, the
# reconstructions of Claude Code's own preset, or the pulled-in published
# chat prompts. Two reasons, stated plainly so a future agent understands the
# intent and not just the rule:
#   1. Reproducing Claude Code's private preset, or aggregating Anthropic's
#      system-prompt methodology, is not something we redistribute — we keep it
#      to the machine where it's already lawfully present (this session).
#   2. The rest is just working substrate that would clutter the program repo.
#
# The ONLY things tracked are the deliverables we actually ship: the eventual
# replacement for the appended coding system prompt, and any sub-agent system
# prompts we author here. Tracking is OPT-IN — add an explicit un-ignore
# (`!name`) for each deliverable as it is created, so nothing leaks by accident.

# Ignore everything by default...
*

# ...except this policy file, and deliverables explicitly opted in below.
!.gitignore

# Deliverables (uncomment / add as we create them):
# !coding-system-prompt.md
# !subagents/
